From: CBS Radio Platform <dev@ephraitech.example>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 10:04:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/25] docs: add the revised proposal and the signed-off
 six-week scope

The proposal revised after the scope gap analysis, and the scope sign-off both parties signed: web only,
Mobile Money as a secondary payment path, presenter portal, admin panel, SMS and email confirmations, and the
settings screen. Native mobile, physical gift fulfilment, multi-language templates and card payments are Phase 2.

Stage built: 2026-10-01 to 2026-10-02.
