From e8b24e26c443b3e0e7ee6c45dc8b37acfd64a9f8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CBS Radio Platform <dev@ephraitech.example>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 10:04:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 20/25] feat: add the message editor and voice-note recorder

A dedicated script and stylesheet for the booking form: live count and on-air time, example messages managed by
staff in any language, undo, drafts kept on the visitor's own device, an in-browser recorder with a level meter and
a muted-microphone warning, and checks on length, size and type before a voice note is attached. The server
verifies the true length with ffprobe when it is installed and accepts the files real devices produce.
---
 CONTRIBUTING.md                               |  11 +
 README.md                                     |  27 +
 app/Config/Routes/cbs_radio.php               |  11 +
 .../Admin/MessageTemplateController.php       | 169 ++++
 app/Controllers/BookingController.php         |   6 +
 ...1007090000_CreateMessageTemplatesTable.php |  38 +
 app/Models/MessageTemplateModel.php           |  81 ++
 app/Views/admin/message_templates/form.php    |  82 ++
 app/Views/admin/message_templates/index.php   |  43 +
 public/assets/css/booking.css                 | 119 +++
 public/assets/js/booking.js                   | 777 ++++++++++++++++++
 11 files changed, 1364 insertions(+)
