From 3c51c106507e2838588cd5bcc5512afe498bc948 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CBS Radio Platform <dev@ephraitech.example>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 10:04:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 22/25] test: add the PHPUnit harness and the unit tests

phpunit.xml.dist and a bootstrap that runs the suite on MySQL (CodeIgniter's default test group is SQLite with a
table prefix, which our raw ALTER TABLE migrations cannot use), base test cases, fixture factories and fakes for the
outside world, and real audio fixtures made the way devices make them (audio-only WebM and MP4 are reported by PHP
as video types, which a synthetic file would hide). Unit tests cover the helpers, the sanitiser, voice-note
validation against real audio, the settings registry and every validation rule, and FileManager.
